                  </content>
                  <authorialNote placement="end" eId="note-2" marker="2">
                    <content>
                      <p>Note:	For mission based compacts and default mission based compacts under the <i>Universities Accord (Australian Tertiary Education Commission) Act 202</i><i>6</i>, see <ref href="#part-3">Part 3</ref><i> </i>of that Act.</p>
