                  <heading>ATEC must advise and make recommendations etc.</heading>
                  <subsection eId="schedule-1__amdact-2__item-9__qstr-1__sec-58A__subsec-1">
                    <num>1</num>
                    <content>
                      <p>The ATEC must:</p>
                    </content>
