                    </paragraph>
                    <paragraph eId="schedule-1__amdact-2__item-9__qstr-1__sec-58A__subsec-1__para-ii">
                      <num>ii</num>
                      <content>
                        <p>on other matters relating to;</p>
                      </content>
                      <content>
                        <p>the Higher Education Standards Framework, if requested by <role refersTo="#minister">the Minister</role> or on the ATEC’s own initiative; and</p>
                      </content>
                    </paragraph>
                    <paragraph eId="schedule-1__amdact-2__item-9__qstr-1__sec-58A__subsec-1__para-b">
                      <num>b</num>
                      <content>
